    <string name="md_sync_enable">Keep notes as Markdown files</string>
    <string name="md_sync_choose">Choose folder</string>
    <string name="md_sync_now">Sync now</string>
    <string name="md_sync_hint">Every note is kept as its own .md file in a folder you choose, one subfolder per account, and stays in sync both ways: edit a note in the widget or in Keep and the file changes; edit the file in another app (Obsidian, Markor, …) and the note changes. New .md files in the folder become new notes. Deleting a file does not delete the note; a note removed in Keep moves its file to the subfolder _removed. If both sides changed, the newer one wins and the other is kept as a .conflict file. Images are copied next to the files but cannot be changed there. Edits from other apps arrive within moments while the app is running, otherwise at the next sync.</string>
